    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ev3_t", "x": 454, "y": 620, "width": 370, "height": 69,
      "text": "SkyCraft-Monthly-Budget  $100  monthly\n   50 %  Actual  → you\n   80 %  Actual  → you\n  100 %  Actual  → you + Malfurion\n# alerts only, spending continues",
      "originalText": "SkyCraft-Monthly-Budget  $100  monthly\n   50 %  Actual  → you\n   80 %  Actual  → you\n  100 %  Actual  → you + Malfurion\n# alerts only, spending continues",
